Fairway
A Beli-style golf course ranking app for the browser. Rate, rank, and track rounds across 127 Bay Area and Northern California golf courses (plus national icons).

Live demo — open fairway.html in any browser, no server needed.
Features
Browse 127 courses across San Francisco, East Bay, Peninsula, Marin, Napa, Monterey/Pebble Beach, Sacramento, Tahoe, and more
Beli-style head-to-head ranking system
Log rounds with scores, favorite holes, and notes
Handicap Index calculator (simplified WHS formula)
Bucket list and favorites
Works offline, no backend required — all data stays in your browser
Usage
Just open fairway.html in a browser. No install, no dependencies.
License
CC0 1.0 Universal — public domain. Do whatever you want with it.

